  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/12/IMG_3594.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(18 fotos) La medianoche del jueves al viernes ha comenzado la campa&ntilde;a para las elecciones generales del 20 de diciembre. En Onda han tenido protagonismo especial Juan Miguel Salvador P&eacute;rez, n&uacute;mero 3 del PSOE al Congreso por Castell&oacute;n,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/12/IMG_3604.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>y Carmen Ballester Feliu, suplente en la lista del PP al Senado.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/enganxadacartellseleccionsgenerals15/img_3582.jpg\" alt=\"img_3582\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/enganxadacartellseleccionsgenerals15/img_3583.jpg\" alt=\"img_3583\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/enganxadacartellseleccionsgenerals15/img_3585.jpg\" alt=\"img_3585\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/enganxadacartellseleccionsgenerals15/img_3586.jpg\" alt=\"img_3586\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/enganxadacartellseleccionsgenerals15/img_3587.jpg\" alt=\"img_3587\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/enganxadacartellseleccionsgenerals15/img_3588.jpg\" alt=\"img_3588\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/enganxadacartellseleccionsgenerals15/img_3594.jpg\" alt=\"img_3594\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.